flowchart LR
  subgraph Repository[Repository and editorial workflow]
    Review[Review CSV]
    Audit[Source / image / risk audit]
    JSON[Questions and cards JSON]
    Images[Bundled card images]
    Review --> Audit --> JSON
  end

  subgraph CI[GitHub Actions]
    Validate[Manifest and content validation]
    Quality[Format / analyze / tests]
    Build[Web / Debug APK / Release AAB]
  end

  subgraph App[Flutter application]
    Repo[Strict asset repositories]
    Policy[Runtime release policy and SHA-256]
    UI[Onboarding / Home / Quiz / Collection / Settings]
    Save[(SharedPreferences)]
    Repo --> Policy --> UI
    UI <--> Save
  end

  JSON --> Validate
  Images --> Validate
  Validate --> Quality --> Build
  JSON --> Repo
  Images --> Repo
